      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76e",
          "text": "Although an insurance company may try to take advantage of you to pay as little as possible, an attorney will fight for the full and fair value of your car accident claim. This is why it is important to consult with an attorney before accepting an insurance settlement.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b76h",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76g",
          "text": "Colorado’s Fault-Based Insurance System",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b76j",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76i",
          "text": "The state that you live in most likely either operates as a fault or no-fault state. The majority of the country uses a fault-based law. This means that in a car accident case, the party at fault for causing the crash will be liable for damages. Colorado is a fault state, meaning that you must identify the person or party that caused your wreck before you can file an insurance claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b76l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76k",
          "text": "You will file your claim with the insurance provider of the responsible party. Then, you must prove that this party is more likely than not responsible for causing your accident to receive insurance benefits. In a no-fault car accident state, on the other hand, you would file with your own insurer, regardless of fault and without having to prove liability. The benefits available in a fault state generally exceed those in a no-fault state, however.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b76n",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76m",
          "text": "Contact Our Thornton Car Accident Lawyers Today For a Free Case Evaluation",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b76v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l76p",
