        },
        {
          "_key": "l76s",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "tel:+13037474404"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76o",
          "text": "At Dormer Harpring, LLC, we prioritize the well-being of our clients. We will do what it takes to help you and your family recover from a serious car accident in Thornton. We have years of experience going up against insurance companies and fighting for our client’s rights. If you or a loved one has been injured in an automobile accident of any kind, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76q",
          "text": "contact us today",
          "marks": [
            "l76p"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76r",
          "text": " to request a free case evaluation. We are here to listen to your story and provide sound legal advice. Please call ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s76t",
